{"screen_name": "oekaki00033", "file": "oekaki00033-a635c3", "name": "404", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1958924987106304000/6pEUFG2d.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1510592857723514885/1755879098/1500x500", "description": "fanart用 基本不在", "total_works": 15, "scraped_works": 15, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T16:06:08.196986+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T16:06:08.196986+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 12000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T16:06:08.196986+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 12000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 12000, "max": 12000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/bspmBIGLOVE", "name": "bspmBIGLOVE"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ba4a625/uploads/origins/aa5b3707-6856-4c9f-908c-f512f585bd3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=816b0a96b3e25c07dbb4f6981c68ac83", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ba4a625/uploads/origins/aa5b3707-6856-4c9f-908c-f512f585bd3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=816b0a96b3e25c07dbb4f6981c68ac83, https://si.imgix.net/6ba4a625/uploads/origins/aa5b3707-6856-4c9f-908c-f512f585bd3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98a293cc2e112ee6ae51235198456196 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ba4a625/uploads/origins/aa5b3707-6856-4c9f-908c-f512f585bd3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1cbf3baf04e13481b2b1536618fe6bd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お疲れ様です。峰尾ゆいと申します。\n募集中というステータスを見てうちの娘を描いて頂きたく思いリクエスト申請いたしました。\n\n【用途】\n・SNS　X（旧Twitter等のSNS媒体のヘッダー・アイコン等）\n・小説投稿サイト小説家になろう等の宣伝活動\n\n【依頼内容】\nうちの娘、「魔女」のイラストをお願いいたします。\n\nデフォルメ・等身キャラの指定はないので\n先生の描きやすい分野でのイラストおまかせします。\n\n・構図→一般的な魔女が箒に乗る構図でお願いします。向きに関しては描きやすい方向で問題ないです\n・表情→明るい感じを軸でおまかせします\n・魔女の服装→色に関しては考えていないのでおまかせでお願いします\n・髪の色→黒髪でおねがいします\n・箒について→先端は出来るだけ資料に近い形を希望します後ろの部分は一般的な箒で大丈夫です\n\n・その他、先生のおまかせで良い感じに出来上がる感じでお願いします\n\n魔女の資料は下記URLでの（旧XTwitter）ご確認ください。\n全体\nhttps://twitter.com/mineoyui/status/1761030774781046910/photo/1\n動きあり\nhttps://twitter.com/mineoyui/status/1761030774781046910/photo/2\n構図\nhttps://twitter.com/mineoyui/status/1761030774781046910/photo/3\nの順です\n\n服装の腰に付いているものは日記帳（本）です。\n\nお忙しいとは思いますが、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e15c4e2/uploads/origins/c6b53bd5-a4a7-492a-b938-98994dc20945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83b0d48f32d9e1c0ea3f1a4aa4328a7d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e15c4e2/uploads/origins/c6b53bd5-a4a7-492a-b938-98994dc20945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83b0d48f32d9e1c0ea3f1a4aa4328a7d, https://si.imgix.net/2e15c4e2/uploads/origins/c6b53bd5-a4a7-492a-b938-98994dc20945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a0a89cb15be3f52b9483911a7ef76c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e15c4e2/uploads/origins/c6b53bd5-a4a7-492a-b938-98994dc20945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=219daef0d173a3b6f624977d065b0519 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I absolutely adore you artwork and would love to work with you! \n\nWould you be willing to draw my Vtuber? She is an Angel Machine cursed to be alone.  I provided a reference that'd I'd like for the pose and overall background and vibe.  Also, please make her eyelashes white! Thank you! \n\nVtuber: https://twitter.com/wettmilkk/status/1535213468768411648?t=n7wxGXcG2DdK91oUMrhb4w&s=19\n\n\nReference: https://images.app.goo.gl/U89qHpW3VhMcARcn8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec1be126/uploads/origins/94472adb-9275-4b49-9c80-bd70cec8cc8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be8df157d38a1b459cd3141b901f7cec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec1be126/uploads/origins/94472adb-9275-4b49-9c80-bd70cec8cc8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be8df157d38a1b459cd3141b901f7cec, https://si.imgix.net/ec1be126/uploads/origins/94472adb-9275-4b49-9c80-bd70cec8cc8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eb2c37eec9a6f230b571f761912933b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec1be126/uploads/origins/94472adb-9275-4b49-9c80-bd70cec8cc8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e750f4d62ce9308f6eb72999db453656 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/353d9225/uploads/origins/a8bd7b81-4d98-4ec0-97ff-e9dc77df159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f49d960943812cee42afc0b25840273", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/353d9225/uploads/origins/a8bd7b81-4d98-4ec0-97ff-e9dc77df159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f49d960943812cee42afc0b25840273, https://si.imgix.net/353d9225/uploads/origins/a8bd7b81-4d98-4ec0-97ff-e9dc77df159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fb675cdf6e8425547fe6bcef3e2178d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/353d9225/uploads/origins/a8bd7b81-4d98-4ec0-97ff-e9dc77df159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80bbcb1ab46a5c3af2f98a4d987ee520 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! Your art is so amazing and I would love to have you draw my VTuber character. The composition is up to you, but can you make them look handsome and cool.\n\nI would like to share your art on SNS while crediting you. I look forward to seeing it!\n\nReference: https://twitter.com/BubbyButtVT/status/1529797613213700096/photo/1\nReference: https://twitter.com/BubbyButtVT/status/1528380743801573378/photo/1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd2e93d0660752cd03cf285b337a5a35", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd2e93d0660752cd03cf285b337a5a35, https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e4db7824c9a5ad86e9acd26f8168efc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9dbae5e4/uploads/origins/8ef9009f-818b-41ea-ac34-e84de5520106?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77862b24b537104f90e12f1de64fa826 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私の名前はナナミンです。 私はあなたの絵が大好きなので、是非私と妹のキャラクター全身イラストを描いてもらいたいです!　ポーズと表情はお任せします。\n\nナナミン：\n身長は１６０ｃｍ\n意地悪で、大切な人達以外どうでもいい\n感情がよく分からないのでいつも無表情\n退屈が大嫌いで共感ができない\n負の感情から生まれた彼女は負の感情に惹かれる\n魔法がめちゃくちゃ強いです\n悪魔の姿を描いてください。\n\nMyste：\n身長は１６６ｃｍ\n性格は冷静でクール。\n種族はエルフ。\n彼女は研究員です、アノマリーリサーチャーです。\n\n差し支えなければ、私のSNSやサムネイルに使用したいので、できればレイヤーを分けていただけないでしょうか。\n承諾していただけると嬉しいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1V1K3U_OHUzEl0Khsb_A4Jec0_ur6A4m5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ad66fbecd7d6b725da98ebd663b9b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=453ad66fbecd7d6b725da98ebd663b9b, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f87aaaeb4582cbaee7a680e428c56857 2x, https://si.imgix.net/579e7650/uploads/origins/f4c6bcb9-4cc5-43aa-aedd-74ed68c2ee3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21f4c072457cb517b62a3f2321a3bac2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Nice to meet you, I adore your art style. I'd like for you to draw my character.\n\n▶Character A (183cm):\nA handsome young detective with a somewhat violent streak. Outwardly a mild-mannered gentleman, his job is to track down spies who have fled from various organizations. He uses binding cords as well as handcuffs for his captors. Broad shoulders. Feel free to draw him with or without the coat, simplifying the details of his outfit is OK. His motifs are \"spider lilies\", \"fireworks\", \"foggy city\" and \"red cords\". Please note the details in the URL.\n\n▶Request details\nPlease draw him looking cool! I leave the pose and composition up to you, however some suggestions for it would be: smoking from a tobacco pipe or kiseru, wiping blood from his face, or adjusting his gloves.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/221k4jpv7mvc", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337e7394894ac3e5a192f4675ca79188", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=337e7394894ac3e5a192f4675ca79188, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=273ba7e1c347dfbf233075f07ab789ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d8535fdb/uploads/origins/a9cd4933-3139-4c92-bb14-77c60a516d89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74ad66d6bff03262b76d66f6a06f87cb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nI was looking at the miniature art you did (especially the last one) and they're all so pretty. I like the soft feeling and the lighting a lot. It would be great if I could request something for these two characters:\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/wqq9pK5\n(But with this clothing https://imgur.com/a/SlkCeCK)\n\nAnd \n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/UeKcZXj\n\n(The owner of the red haired girl is my gf and not me, so I don't have many references of her, sorry.) \n\nThe poses and everything else can be anything you want.\nThank you for considering 🙂\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/UeKcZXjhttps://imgur.com/a/wqq9pK5", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c8284e6/uploads/origins/b1e6f6d3-82ca-4800-b345-2e5ea31e3403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=955cad3173198539f09f1cfc0dce173c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c8284e6/uploads/origins/b1e6f6d3-82ca-4800-b345-2e5ea31e3403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=955cad3173198539f09f1cfc0dce173c, https://si.imgix.net/9c8284e6/uploads/origins/b1e6f6d3-82ca-4800-b345-2e5ea31e3403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df427ff273b31bb04e1a7a5beb46f997 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c8284e6/uploads/origins/b1e6f6d3-82ca-4800-b345-2e5ea31e3403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4c4ff0a9f8a999ad667f7c6952dcd90 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!! I really like the chibi and the style of your paintings! Is it okay for you to draw these two: \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DVMYCJQU0J7fhUIU-hELI1UHtoCOzP0x?usp=sharing\nThey are a couple, they live in France together. Feel free to cancel the request if you think you can't do it.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/33b24c7c/uploads/origins/828f4d63-a7ec-4f4c-865b-067a7f1ffc0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0467912803dc1bd45081839e3c3ee07", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/33b24c7c/uploads/origins/828f4d63-a7ec-4f4c-865b-067a7f1ffc0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0467912803dc1bd45081839e3c3ee07, https://si.imgix.net/33b24c7c/uploads/origins/828f4d63-a7ec-4f4c-865b-067a7f1ffc0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2436e41e7e2c02064117b4faaa9c8998 2x, https://si.imgix.net/33b24c7c/uploads/origins/828f4d63-a7ec-4f4c-865b-067a7f1ffc0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=469ff9ffcb7b874701f6112877bc2eb7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I love your mini characters! I'd love you to draw my two characters if possible. They are a husband and wife pair. I'd like it if they were drawn in cutesy matching outfits like the examples I provided in the reference link. They are a power couple and are very badass/independent on their own (the wife is a CFO and the husband is CEO at a different company), but they get very soft together and like to do cute couple things. I thought your artstyle would suit them being lovey dovey by matching outfits!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2c75iuqat26?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/74edd560/uploads/origins/5113089a-9e92-419d-b288-75e7bcc73869?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69ba413cad27f2bdcaca7f53526e6303", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74edd560/uploads/origins/5113089a-9e92-419d-b288-75e7bcc73869?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69ba413cad27f2bdcaca7f53526e6303, https://si.imgix.net/74edd560/uploads/origins/5113089a-9e92-419d-b288-75e7bcc73869?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7ce226dae4f1676b5f40ebc41a9162a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74edd560/uploads/origins/5113089a-9e92-419d-b288-75e7bcc73869?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=894ad2edc123f88ada08e0d65dc99fee 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "始めまして！ 海外から送ります。あなたが描くミニキャラクターがとてもかわいいです。できればキャラクター2人を描いていただけませんか?\n\nJKの幼なじみという設定で、とても仲の良い友達です。服装はシミラールックなら何でもOKです。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1spi1kl-deP_rA5eF8ISP9aLMgVIdFSTQ?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oekaki00033/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/58279e72/uploads/origins/0315b22c-72d0-450a-92fa-447d52cab9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f80b708bb4923be5d212925cf5c2d277", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58279e72/uploads/origins/0315b22c-72d0-450a-92fa-447d52cab9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f80b708bb4923be5d212925cf5c2d277, https://si.imgix.net/58279e72/uploads/origins/0315b22c-72d0-450a-92fa-447d52cab9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2b6137ed078f9949fc8bb6a91608260 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58279e72/uploads/origins/0315b22c-72d0-450a-92fa-447d52cab9bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=039fb6539b7255294bb791c869aa79e6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "再度依頼失礼します。\n私の創作キャラのデザインをして欲しいです。かっこいい服のアイデアが欲しいです。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1CqTvZcA-42YLkzNIE-9XsPnSvkC-Ovat/v